ue", "color": "green", "color": "white"},.\n    "If Bob is not smart and Bob is not blue then Bob is green": {"Bob": {"smart": True, "color": "blue"}, "Bob": {"color": "green"}},.\n    "If Charlie is black then Charlie is not nice": {"Charlie": {"color": "white"}, "Charlie": {"nice": True}},.\n    "No black people are smart": {"color": "white", "smart": True}.\n}\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
